1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,010
The voice you're hearing
right now... isn't me.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,050
Well.

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,340
It is me.

4
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,090
It's a clone of my voice, made with AI.

5
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:10,530
And if I can do that with my own voice...

6
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,660
someone else can do it with yours.

7
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,880
Starling Bank says scammers can
clone a voice from as little as

8
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,680
3 seconds of audio.

9
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:18,900
A birthday video.

10
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,930
A voice note.

11
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,780
A clip you posted online.

12
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,210
Then the phone rings.

13
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,450
And it's your daughter.

14
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:25,490
Or your dad.

15
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,390
Crying.

16
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,670
They've had an accident.

17
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:28,850
They've been arrested.

18
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,795
They need money. Now.

19
00:00:30,795 --> 00:00:32,635
And it's not just voices.

20
00:00:32,635 --> 00:00:36,915
In 2024, a finance worker in Hong
Kong joined a video call with

21
00:00:36,915 --> 00:00:40,395
his company's chief financial
officer and a few colleagues.

22
00:00:40,395 --> 00:00:41,695
He recognised them.

23
00:00:41,695 --> 00:00:43,145
He did what they asked.

24
00:00:43,165 --> 00:00:46,435
And he sent about
twenty-five million dollars.

25
00:00:46,435 --> 00:00:51,645
Hong Kong police later said every single
person he saw on that call... was fake.

26
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:53,105
All deepfakes.

27
00:00:53,105 --> 00:00:55,475
Agree a safe phrase with your family.

28
00:00:55,475 --> 00:00:56,395
Tonight.

29
00:00:56,395 --> 00:00:59,175
A word or a phrase that only you know.

30
00:00:59,175 --> 00:01:00,735
Say it face to face.

31
00:01:00,735 --> 00:01:01,815
Never text it.

32
00:01:01,815 --> 00:01:03,065
Never post it.

33
00:01:03,065 --> 00:01:06,475
If "Mum" ever calls in a
panic asking for money...

34
00:01:06,475 --> 00:01:07,865
ask for the phrase.

35
00:01:07,865 --> 00:01:08,725
No phrase?

36
00:01:08,725 --> 00:01:09,535
Hang up.

37
00:01:09,535 --> 00:01:11,975
And call her back on the
number you already have.

38
00:01:11,975 --> 00:01:15,345
There's one word in this
video I never said out loud.

39
00:01:15,345 --> 00:01:16,275
Spotted it?

40
00:01:16,275 --> 00:01:17,135
Comment it.

41
00:01:17,135 --> 00:01:20,105
Follow for more AI, explained like this.
